      },
      "lineNbr": 137,
      "author": {
        "id": 1042276
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-12-10T20:42:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure.  Basically it doesn\u0027t feel impossible to \"splice\" L139 and L146, but it\u0027s probably not trivial to create a reasonable interface.  For example, if the write could expose a buffer to be written into, it\u0027ll achieve this goal.  But that probably won\u0027t work with the virtio transport.\n\nUpdated the comment.",
      "parentUuid": "af22821d_39002a3a",
      "revId": "6ddab6e3ef4f5fc08b84b5344bbbee5f7e348841",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
